{
  "name": "西夏文自动标注工具",
  "short_name": "西夏文标注",
  "description": "西夏文自动标注工具是一个在线工具，旨在帮助用户处理和研究西夏文字。目前支持通过笔画、LFW序号、四角号码和Unicode码位四种方式输入西夏文字，并提供语音、语法标注以及语义信息的中英双语输出。
  The Tangut Script Annotation Tool is an online tool designed to help users process and study the Tangut script. It currently supports four input methods for Tangut characters: stroke-based input, LFW codes, Four-Corner Codes, and Unicode code points. It also provides bilingual Chinese-English output with phonetic and grammatical annotations, as well as semantic information.",
